[2026-03-16T03:49:23.128Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PDJUBRPMcJZBRtJxrp6ito","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me provide a comprehensive summary of all the User Profile page-related files.\n\n## Summary: User Profile Page Files in AirbnbClone\n\nI've found all files related to the \"User Profile\" page. Here's a complete overview:\n\n### Main Page Component\n\n**1. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Profile.tsx`**\n- Main page component at `/profile` route\n- Requires authentication (redirects to login if not logged in)\n- Displays three main sections: Personal Info, Become Host button, and Reviews list\n- Uses Redux for state management (auth and userReviews)\n- Fetches user reviews on component mount\n\n### Profile-Specific Components\n\n**2. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/ProfileForm.tsx`**\n- Form for editing user profile information\n- Editable fields: name, bio, phone, avatar URL\n- Read-only field: email\n- Displays avatar preview with user icon fallback\n- Includes form validation (name required, valid URL for avatar)\n- Shows success/error messages\n- Updates user via Redux `updateUser` action\n\n**3. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/UserReviewsList.tsx`**\n- Displays all reviews written by the logged-in user\n- Shows empty state when no reviews exist\n- Displays review cards with property title, rating (star display), comment, and date\n- Links to reviewed properties for navigation\n- Fetches reviews via Redux `fetchUserReviews` action\n\n**4. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BecomeHostButton.tsx`**\n- Allows users to upgrade to host status\n- Shows confirmation dialog before becoming a host\n- Displays success message after upgrade\n- Hidden for existing hosts (unless showing success message)\n- Uses Redux `becomeHost` action\n\n### Redux State Management\n\n**5. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/userReviewsSlice.ts`**\n- Redux slice for managing user reviews state\n- Defines `UserReview` interface with fields: id, booking_id, property_id, guest_id, rating, cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value, comment, created_at, property_title\n- Provides `fetchUserReviews` async thunk (GET `/api/reviews?guest_id={guestId}`)\n- Manages loading and error states\n\n**6. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/authSlice.ts`**\n- Redux slice for authentication and user data\n- Defines `User` interface with fields: id, email, name, avatar_url, bio, phone, is_host, created_at\n- Provides `updateUser` async thunk (PUT `/api/users/{id}`) for profile updates\n- Provides `becomeHost` async thunk (POST `/api/users/{id}/become-host`)\n- Persists user data to localStorage\n\n**7. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/store.ts`**\n- Redux store configuration\n- Includes `userReviews` and `auth` reducers\n\n### Supporting Files\n\n**8. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx`**\n- Application routing - defines `/profile` route pointing to Profile component\n- Wraps all pages with Sidebar and Footer\n\n### Test Files\n\n**9. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/profile-form.spec.ts`**\n- Comprehensive Playwright tests for ProfileForm component\n- Tests profile display, field editing (name, bio, phone, avatar), validation, persistence\n\n**10. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/profile-host-reviews.spec.ts`**\n- Playwright tests for BecomeHostButton and UserReviewsList components\n- Tests host status changes, confirmation dialogs, review display, and review list updates\n\n### File Paths Summary\n\n1. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Profile.tsx`\n2. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/ProfileForm.tsx`\n3. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/UserReviewsList.tsx`\n4. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BecomeHostButton.tsx`\n5. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/userReviewsSlice.ts`\n6. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/authSlice.ts`\n7. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/store.ts`\n8. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx`\n9. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/profile-form.spec.ts`\n10. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/profile-host-reviews.spec.ts`\n\nAll file contents have been provided above in the read results."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a36ee2f96e321bc7b (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 43325\ntool_uses: 19\nduration_ms: 24822</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2015f33-7e41-4354-a03c-200e58f28506","uuid":"88137d3d-ac5e-4088-8829-2125afa9509e","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find all files related to the \"User Profile\" page in /repo/apps/AirbnbClone. Look for:\n1. The main page component (likely in src/pages/ or similar)\n2. Any components specifically used by the profile page\n3. Read all these files and return their full contents and paths.\n\nBe thorough - check src/pages/, src/components/, and any related files.","agentId":"a36ee2f96e321bc7b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me provide a comprehensive summary of all the User Profile page-related files.\n\n## Summary: User Profile Page Files in AirbnbClone\n\nI've found all files related to the \"User Profile\" page. Here's a complete overview:\n\n### Main Page Component\n\n**1. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Profile.tsx`**\n- Main page component at `/profile` route\n- Requires authentication (redirects to login if not logged in)\n- Displays three main sections: Personal Info, Become Host button, and Reviews list\n- Uses Redux for state management (auth and userReviews)\n- Fetches user reviews on component mount\n\n### Profile-Specific Components\n\n**2. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/ProfileForm.tsx`**\n- Form for editing user profile information\n- Editable fields: name, bio, phone, avatar URL\n- Read-only field: email\n- Displays avatar preview with user icon fallback\n- Includes form validation (name required, valid URL for avatar)\n- Shows success/error messages\n- Updates